On 22 Oct CNC2 stopped at about 0215 with SP104 on the screen. Grinding noise from the spindle, vibration alarm. When I opened it up I found the bearings worn. I replaced BRG 7014 ACD x2 and KLB2 grease and SEAL SPDL 70. Next time check the spindle first. Please tell the next shift if it comes back.

Arun
